Subject: [PATCH 19/42] tv: touches fall through views that do not use them
 (inert views are not pick targets; custom-dispatch views like Compose that
 decline a hover/DOWN become transparent there), inline dialog outside-touch
 by bounds - CloudStream TV layout had full-screen overlays, nothing was
 clickable

